0:16.738">a </span><span begin="00:16.738" end="00:16.930">room</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.099" end="00:18.264"><span begin="00:17.099" end="00:17.290">And </span><span begin="00:17.290" end="00:17.715">everyone </span><span begin="00:17.715" end="00:18.115">respects </span><span begin="00:18.115" end="00:18.264">him</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.599" end="00:19.520"><span begin="00:18.599" end="00:18.800">And </span><span begin="00:18.800" end="00:18.999">he </span><span begin="00:18.999" end="00:19.191">reads </span><span begin="00:19.191" end="00:19.415">the </span><span begin="00:19.415" end="00:19.520">news</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.688" end="00:21.690"><span begin="00:19.688" end="00:19.872">And </span><span begin="00:19.872" end="00:20.160">doesn't </span><span begin="00:20.160" end="00:20.400">let </span><span begin="00:20.400" end="00:20.483">that </span><span begin="00:20.483" end="00:20.874">**** </span><span begin="00:20.874" end="00:21.251">affect </span><span begin="00:21.251" end="00:21.690">him</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.946" end="00:24.443"><span begin="00:21.946" end="00:22.155">He's </span><span begin="00:22.155" end="00:22.491">really </span><span begin="00:22.491" end="00:22.611">happy </span><span begin="00:23.051" end="00:23.299">he's </span><span begin="00:23.299" end="00:23.506">thrilled </span><span begin="00:23.506" end="00:23.715">to </span><span begin="00:23.715" end="00:23.987">be </span><span begin="00:23.987" end="00:24.443">alive</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.747" end="00:27.510"><span begin="00:24.747" end="00:24.947">His </span><span begin="00:24.947" end="00:25.131">name </span><span begin="00:25.131" end="00:25.323">is </span><span begin="00:25.323" end="00:25.530">any </span><span begin="00:25.530" end="00:25.859">white </span><span begin="00:25.859" end="00:26.227">guy </span><span begin="00:26.227" end="00:26.411">in </span><span begin="00:26.411" end="00:27.510"